    "explanation": "Decision addressed to both parties. The contested amount is the SGD 4.50 cancellation fee on EV-FARE-02719 (cancellation_fee 4.50, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00).\n\nAll four limbs of POL-NS-01 hold, so the charge stands. (a) EV-TRIP-02719 carries the driver's 'arrived' event at 07:39:37. (b) EV-GPS-02719 places the driver inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius of POL-NS-02: 37 fixes qualify under the 25 m accuracy filter, and the qualifying run begins at exactly 07:39:37 (dwell_start_offset_sec 0.0), so the marker and the first in-geofence fix coincide and no POL-NS-05 recomputation is required. (c) The driver held position inside the radius continuously for 360 s, 07:39:37 to 07:45:37, against this trip's 180 s free waiting period (EV-TRIP-02719 platform_policy.free_wait_sec); platform_policy.no_show_threshold_sec is null. (d) There is no boarding event and the driver terminated at 07:45:40 under cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, 183 s after the 180 s dwell elapsed at 07:42:37. No clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06, and none of POL-NS-10, displaces the fee. POL-NS-07 therefore fixes the payout at 80 percent of the SGD 4.50 net fee = SGD 3.60, which is the figure EV-FARE-02719's money block computes; the anti-farming check does not trip (driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d 1 is below 4, and 1/133 completed trips in 30 days = 0.0075 is below 0.08), so the ruling is DRIVER_COMPENSATION and the SGD 3.60 is both the compensation and the amount this ruling moves. The fee itself is not refunded.\n\nRider: I accept your two main facts. Your track in EV-GPS-02719 places you at the pin throughout - 66 fixes, all stationary (0.0 km/h), 2.7 m to 10.6 m from the pin, 07:37:49 to 07:47:33 - inside the 100 m STANDARD rider-presence radius, and the driver's closest approach was 41.42 m, so your 'parked a bit away' is corroborated by his own trace and his 'I was right at the pin' is not. But neither fact decides the case: 41.42 m is still inside the 50 m radius POL-NS-02 defines as arrival, and the radius, not the pin, is the test; rider position is answered by POL-NS-04, not by the arrival clause. POL-NS-04 needs all three limbs and fails at limb (a): it requires a rider message whose content is locating or coordinating, and 'ok' at 07:41:07 names no position, entrance, block or bay, asks for nothing and does not say you could not see the vehicle. Limbs (b) and (c) are made out (driver silent for 273 s, no in-app call; you at the pin on every admissible fix), but limb (a) is not, so the clause does not exonerate you. I also reject your submission that POL-NS-01(d) fails because you were present: limb (d) is a test on the trip record - no boarding event, termination under one of the three recognised reason codes at or after the dwell - and this record satisfies it; the only in-radius outcome in which POL-NS-01 itself refunds is a cancellation recorded DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, which is not the code here. POL-NS-03 is not open either: every stationary fix lies inside the arrival radius, and registered_pickup_points is 1, not the 2 or more limb (ii) requires, so no pin-ambiguity goodwill arises.\n\nDriver: your limbs (a) to (d) and your reading of POL-NS-05, POL-NS-06 and POL-NS-03 are accepted. One correction to your own account: your closest approach was 41.42 m, not the pin itself; the 50 m radius makes that immaterial, and the trace is dense (10 s cadence, 100.0 percent coverage, 0 s maximum gap), so the arrival test could be run properly. You were right not to assert POL-NS-06(i): EV-ADVIS-02719-01 is MISSING (issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, weight_multiplier 0.0) and carries nothing, and the hold is a single continuous 360 s interval, so accumulation is unnecessary and the shortfall is -180 s.\n\nEvidence and confidence: the facts that decide this case are carried by EV-GPS-02719 and EV-TRIP-02719, both weight_multiplier 1.0 and COMPLETE, so under POL-GEN-02(2) my confidence is capped at 1.0; I set it at 0.9. The driver's statement carries no weight_multiplier, so it enters neither the minimum nor the maximum of that cap. No POL-NS-09 trigger is present: disputes_with_counterparty_90d is 0 on both sides, no_show_disputes_30d is 0, no admissible artifact contradicts another on arrival, dwell or rider presence, and no deciding artifact is impaired. Under POL-GEN-01 the only profile fields used are those POL-NS-07 names.\n\nThe monetary effect is SGD 3.60, below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold of POL-GEN-05, so it is executed on issue. This is a provisional ruling made without human review; either party may appeal within 30 days under POL-GEN-04."
